%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7087a33b9b694f98874cb605de3959ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: OnboardingDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Lisa
  characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9145949f82f262b42a935c86b39eeb21, type: 3}
  entries:
  - text: 'Hi! Im Lisa, I''ll help you make the right moves to stimulate your profile
      so the Hiring manager will headhunt you and call you in for an interview


      Let''s
      look at your profile'
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: The current job market is so competitive, but with the right cards you
      can land your next position in a flash. When you click on an event you'll gain
      a card and learn a skill
    panelToActivate: 2
    showCharacter: 0
  - text: Showing that you're constantly applying yourself, towards your interests
      is what recruiters like to see
    panelToActivate: 2
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: So this is how your CV looks like.
    panelToActivate: 1
    showCharacter: 0
  - text: Soft skills build shields that help you deal with tough questions, hard
      skills helps you display your understanding of concepts, and your access skills
      are all the great things you've done and can talk about to build yourself up.
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: "When you play cards of the same type together, they become stronger, and
      the same goes for cards of similar skill tags. \n\nAlthough Acess cards count
      both to your hard and soft skills"
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: You can discard one card per turn, but it will cost you some composure
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: When you're ready, you can go in to meet the hiring manager about the job.
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: 'Also, remember to take it easy, failure is part of the process.


      You''ll
      get better as you go along'
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
